OL,3,GNEWSAQuestions over #12m data centre
OL,4,Abid under hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to create a subterranean data
OL,7,Fcentre beneath a town centre hotel have
OL,8,Fpromoted questions about energy use and
OL,9,Fthe potential environmental impact.
OL,11,FThe proposal would see the underground
OL,12,Fcar parks and basement of The Brunlea
OL,13,FHotel, on Keirby Walk in Burnley,
OL,14,Fconverted into a #12m data centre that
OL,15,Fcovers 4,000 sqm (4,784 sq yards) of
OL,16,Ffloorspace beneath the building.
OL,18,FDocuments submitted to Burnley Council
OL,19,Fare scant on information about the
OL,20,Foperation of the data centre, with the
OL,21,Fapplicant describing the scheme as
OL,22,Fsimply "change of use".
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
