OL,3,GNEWSAQuestions over #12m data centre
OL,4,Abid under hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is not clear who would be using the
OL,7,Fdata centre, how much electricity it
OL,8,Fwould consume, or if it would create
OL,9,Fany jobs.
